@startuml
title D-04 Payment, Fiscal Issuance, and ExitAuthorization Authority Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

participant "Assisted Payment Terminal" as Terminal
participant "Payment Orchestrator /\nPayment Integration" as Pay
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Resolved Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit System" as Gate

Terminal -> Central : request payment flow for resolved session
Central -> Pay : create / process payment attempt
Pay --> Central : verified provider outcome
Central -> Central : record payment finality
Central -> POS : request Sales Invoice issuance
POS --> Central : Sales Invoice identity / status
Central -> Central : record fiscal issuance reference
Central -> Gate : issue ExitAuthorization
Central --> Terminal : show receipt / pending / exit status

note right of Terminal
Payment-capable channel.
Not payment finality authority.
Not fiscal authority.
Not exit authority.
end note

note right of POS
Issues Sales Invoice.
Does not issue ExitAuthorization.
end note

@enduml
